{
  "_comment": "Phase 11.7 baseline. RE-PINNED 2026-05-16 from MAX-of-9 local runs. Size=1 speedtest1 workloads are 1ms-quantised by GetTickCount64; per-cell ratios swing 3-8x across consecutive runs (75th pct max/min = 7.8x). The max-of-N pinning captures the worst-case ratio observed across N independent runs; paired with REGRESSION_THRESHOLD_PCT=200 in check_regression.sh this gives a stable gate that only fires on a 3x regression beyond observed noise. ratio = pas_ms/c_ms. Per-case ms = seconds*1000. CheckRegression compares new ratio to baseline; fails if (new-baseline)/baseline > REGRESSION_THRESHOLD_PCT/100. See tasklist.md 11.7 + check_regression.sh header for full decision log and re-pin recipe.",
